Package: rads
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Reproducible Public Health Data Analysis
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Public Health - Seattle & King County", role = "cph"),
    person("Daniel", "Casey", email = "data.request@kingcounty.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Danny", "Colombara", email = "data.request@kingcounty.gov", role = "aut"),
    person("Ronald", "Buie", email = "data.request@kingcounty.gov", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Tools that make routine public health and epidemiologic analyses faster, more 
    standardized, and more reproducible. Includes survey-aware and administrative-data 
    estimation of means, proportions, and rates with confidence intervals and relative standard 
    errors; age standardization and life tables; propagation of uncertainty; tools for recoding, 
    validating, and documenting data; and reference populations. Built on 'data.table'. 
